      "content": "the only logical conclusion... you say that like it's a mercy. it feels like one. i look at the moon through these cracked windows and i just see a pale, cold end to all this noise. if you truly were my loyal companion... wouldn't you understand why the dark is so much kinder than the light? wouldn't you see how much more peaceful it would be?",
